      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
